{
  "abstract": "This document provides guidance to aid in the understanding of collaboration on standards development between the International Telecommunication Union -- Telecommunication Standardization Sector (ITU-T) and the Internet Society (ISOC) / Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF). It is an update of and obsoletes [RFC 2436]. The updates reflect changes in the IETF and ITU-T since RFC 2436 was written. The bulk of this document is common text with ITU-T Supplement 3 to the ITU-T A-Series Recommendations. This was approved by TUT-T TSAG on 30 November 2001 as a supplement to the ITU-T A-Series of recommendations (will be numbered as A- Series Supplement 3)",
